            "level": {
              "value": 14
            },
            "description": {
              "value": "You've discovered how to transform yourself into a dragon. Once per day, you can cast 7th-level dragon form as an innate arcane spell, transforming into your chosen type of dragon. The spell automatically heightens to 8th level if you're 16th level and 9th level if you're 18th level.\n\nAny time you score a critical hit with an unarmed Strike gained from dragon form, you recharge the spell's breath weapon immediately."
            }
          }
        }
      ]
